# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files. Fixes the local mix caused by
# core.autocrlf=true + prettier's default endOfLine:lf (eslint was flagging CRLF
# on Write-created files). Committed content is LF; checkouts (incl. CI) are LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never normalize / diff.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.node binary
*.dll  binary
